WEBVTT

02:05.960 --> 02:09.000
The Eldest Princess' marriage
is supposed to be a major event.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.400
Why is it organized so sloppily?

02:10.919 --> 02:12.880
Dingzhou suffered from a disaster.

02:12.960 --> 02:15.440
The Eldest Princess wants a simple wedding
for the people to know

02:15.520 --> 02:18.400
the imperial family's heart
is with the people.

02:19.480 --> 02:21.360
Do you believe
what the imperial family says?

02:21.440 --> 02:23.360
We are wondering

02:23.440 --> 02:26.480
if the Eldest Princess
is carrying an illegitimate child.

02:26.560 --> 02:28.400
It is not Mr. Li Jin's.

02:28.480 --> 02:30.280
The Li family is just a cover.

02:36.080 --> 02:38.240
It seems like
the Eldest Princess's pregnancy is true.

02:38.320 --> 02:39.760
The imperial family rushed their wedding

02:39.840 --> 02:42.040
to stop people from spreading rumors.

04:21.760 --> 04:23.120
I feel dizzy.

04:30.320 --> 04:32.160
I feel so dizzy.

04:42.320 --> 04:45.120
Eldest Princess, Prince Consort,
please drink the crossed-cup wine.

05:02.880 --> 05:03.960
Prince Consort.

05:22.760 --> 05:23.800
Interesting.

05:26.640 --> 05:27.480
How impetuous!

05:29.120 --> 05:30.800
How dare you throw my wine away?

05:36.160 --> 05:39.320
Meixiang, I'm tired.

05:39.800 --> 05:40.920
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:46.960 --> 05:50.320
Prince Consort,
didn't you hear what I said?

08:18.080 --> 08:19.680
What's with your brother today?

08:20.320 --> 08:23.920
It seems like he and Eldest Princess'
affair has been covered up,

08:24.760 --> 08:26.200
so he is feeling more relaxed.

08:26.760 --> 08:29.400
Eat. What are you waiting for?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.840
Yes. Let's eat.

08:37.480 --> 08:40.000
Yurong, I heard

08:40.720 --> 08:44.520
His Majesty has granted marriage
between the Eldest Princess and Mr. Li.

08:45.920 --> 08:47.480
What's your plan?

08:48.160 --> 08:49.960
Can you still become the Prince Consort?

08:51.080 --> 08:52.600
Prince Consort is just a title.

08:52.680 --> 08:53.720
Is it that important?

08:54.480 --> 08:55.480
What do you mean?

08:58.760 --> 08:59.600
Eat.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.160
DUKE SU'S MANSION

09:13.240 --> 09:14.960
How do you feel? Better?

09:16.560 --> 09:19.240
Xue Li, don't visit me so often.

09:20.360 --> 09:23.280
I'm still alive.
I'm already satisfied that I can see you

09:23.360 --> 09:24.240
and Father.

09:24.320 --> 09:26.080
Not only do I want to save you,

09:26.640 --> 09:28.240
but I also want you to live well.

09:35.520 --> 09:37.840
Xue Li, I heard people say

09:38.680 --> 09:41.280
that the Eldest Princess is married.
Is it true?

09:41.360 --> 09:42.520
It's true.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.280
Not to Shen Yurong?

09:45.000 --> 09:46.320
It's a part of my plan.

09:47.640 --> 09:50.760
Anyway, everything is going
in the right direction.

09:51.400 --> 09:52.280
That's great.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.840
After your plan succeeds,

09:54.920 --> 09:56.560
I want to return to Huaixiang with you.

09:57.360 --> 09:59.640
I also want to visit Qiong Zhi.

10:00.880 --> 10:03.480
I wonder if she has cleared her debts.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.480
Do you still remember Qiong Zhi?

10:07.560 --> 10:08.720
Of course.

10:10.160 --> 10:13.040
Perhaps she has forgotten about me.

10:13.680 --> 10:14.640
She still remembers you.

10:15.680 --> 10:16.800
When I went to Luyang,

10:17.360 --> 10:19.640
she was the one
who told me that Father is still alive.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.960
Why did you go to her?

10:21.520 --> 10:24.440
When I first arrived in Luyang,
I didn't know where to go

10:24.520 --> 10:25.360
and thought of her.

10:26.760 --> 10:28.560
She was grateful for your help.

10:29.120 --> 10:32.440
She suffered and helped me find
Father's whereabouts.

10:32.520 --> 10:33.880
Did she ask you

10:34.440 --> 10:36.200
why I didn't go to find her after that?

10:37.480 --> 10:42.160
She cried badly
when she found out you were dead.

10:47.880 --> 10:49.240
How is she now?

10:50.160 --> 10:51.880
She married a good man

10:53.160 --> 10:54.920
and went to a faraway place.

10:56.000 --> 10:58.160
No one will mistreat her again.

11:01.080 --> 11:03.160
Good. That's great.

11:05.040 --> 11:06.400
She's doing well now

11:08.000 --> 11:09.480
and she still remembers me.

11:10.360 --> 11:12.000
That's good enough for me.

11:15.760 --> 11:16.640
The medicine is ready.

11:29.840 --> 11:32.320
Xue Zhao, who are you carving it for?
You're putting a lot of effort into it.

11:33.280 --> 11:34.360
It's for my sweetheart.

11:35.480 --> 11:37.040
When we first met,

11:37.560 --> 11:38.840
I was a decent lady.

11:41.080 --> 11:42.880
He must be very disappointed in me.

11:44.560 --> 11:46.480
That's why he never sought me out again.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.920
She married a good man

11:54.080 --> 11:55.680
and went to a faraway place.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.520
No one will mistreat her again.

12:15.680 --> 12:17.840
I'm lucky today. I got a big one.

12:18.360 --> 12:20.160
Xiao Heng, you can
take a part of the credit.

12:21.160 --> 12:23.680
How long are you going to do this?
I'm dying from the heat.

12:26.240 --> 12:28.200
Let's go. I'm almost done.

12:33.640 --> 12:35.320
Thanks for accompanying me today.

12:36.280 --> 12:37.880
It's rare for you to thank people.

12:38.680 --> 12:39.640
What's the matter?

12:39.720 --> 12:41.440
Only Jiang Li can thank you, but not me?

12:41.520 --> 12:42.600
Are you still angry?

12:43.560 --> 12:45.080
Why would I be angry with her?

12:45.160 --> 12:46.160
She didn't offend me.

12:46.240 --> 12:49.200
Besides, even if I am angry,

12:50.240 --> 12:51.560
will you stand up for me?

12:53.240 --> 12:54.400
No.

12:54.920 --> 12:55.920
There you go.

12:59.680 --> 13:01.400
When are you leaving?

13:02.240 --> 13:03.080
Tomorrow.

13:04.480 --> 13:07.400
Did the discussion fall through?
Did my brother give you a hard time?

13:10.200 --> 13:12.760
Not really.
He only proposed some conditions.

13:13.240 --> 13:15.720
Since Jiuyue returned to Great Zhao,
she had no appetite.

13:16.280 --> 13:17.840
It was like she became another person.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.760
But ever since you came here,

13:19.840 --> 13:21.240
it seems like she's energetic again.

13:22.440 --> 13:23.720
Even if I'm dull,

13:24.240 --> 13:25.360
it's hard for me

13:25.920 --> 13:27.760
not to notice a girl's thoughts.

13:27.840 --> 13:30.400
Xiao Heng, you know this.

13:31.520 --> 13:32.560
Jiuyue

13:32.640 --> 13:34.360
is the only family I have in this world.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.640
I want her to be well.

13:36.720 --> 13:38.040
What do you mean, Your Majesty?

13:38.120 --> 13:39.000
A marriage alliance.

13:40.120 --> 13:42.040
I hope you can be
Great Zhao's Prince Consort.

13:42.760 --> 13:44.440
You're the Emperor
of Great Yan's confidant

13:44.520 --> 13:46.080
and Jiuyue is my sister.

13:46.160 --> 13:47.880
If you two get married,

13:47.960 --> 13:49.560
we will become family.

13:50.120 --> 13:52.760
No promise is more reliable than this.

13:52.840 --> 13:56.120
Jiuyue is at an age suitable for marriage.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.440
And as far as I know,

13:57.520 --> 13:59.320
you are not engaged as well, Duke Su.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.400
And with the current situation
of our nation,

14:02.920 --> 14:04.000
I think

14:04.920 --> 14:06.840
this is a match made in heaven.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.920
What did you say?

14:11.000 --> 14:14.000
Naturally, I told him
it would depend on you.

14:14.080 --> 14:16.000
- If I say--
- Jiuyue,

14:16.080 --> 14:17.360
His Majesty wants to seek peace,

14:17.440 --> 14:18.920
but Prince Cheng is totally different.

14:19.520 --> 14:21.200
Prince Cheng is ambitious and belligerent.

14:21.840 --> 14:24.400
Even if he rules Great Yan,
he won't be satisfied.

14:25.480 --> 14:27.400
When Great Yan and Great Zhao have a war,

14:27.480 --> 14:28.640
- surely--
- Stop.

14:28.720 --> 14:31.880
You know I don't understand all this.

14:33.720 --> 14:35.200
I'm sure

14:36.280 --> 14:37.480
you know what I want to hear.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.440
All right.

14:38.920 --> 14:40.120
I'll tell you honestly then.

14:40.200 --> 14:42.000
First, I must borrow your troops.

14:42.520 --> 14:44.960
Second, I can't agree to the marriage.

14:45.040 --> 14:47.240
Third, if you won't say yes
to my first two conditions,

14:47.320 --> 14:48.440
I'll await my death back home.

14:48.520 --> 14:50.480
You said it would depend on me.

14:50.560 --> 14:52.960
I want you to reject your brother,
of course.

14:53.040 --> 14:55.360
You wish!
No wonder you accompanied me today.

14:55.440 --> 14:57.160
It turns out you have an ulterior motive.

14:57.240 --> 14:58.920
I can't believe this.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.640
Why did I fall for a scoundrel like you?

15:00.720 --> 15:03.800
Flattery is what a scoundrel does.
Isn't it good to be honest with you?

15:05.640 --> 15:07.840
Forget it if you won't save us.
I'll await my death back home.

15:11.000 --> 15:11.840
Come back!

15:18.320 --> 15:19.240
This is the last time.

15:19.800 --> 15:20.640
After this,

15:22.360 --> 15:23.760
I don't care where you'd die.

15:46.600 --> 15:49.120
Go away! All of you!

15:52.920 --> 15:54.240
- Prince Consort.
- Prince Consort.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.280
What's wrong again?

15:56.120 --> 15:59.360
Eldest Princess said
the breakfast made her feel sick.

15:59.840 --> 16:00.960
You may go.

16:01.040 --> 16:02.120
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:25.640 --> 16:28.000
Your Highness, I heard them say

16:28.480 --> 16:31.360
that the food doesn't suit your taste.

16:31.440 --> 16:33.320
They make me feel sick.

16:33.880 --> 16:35.120
My mother

16:35.840 --> 16:38.840
prepared the food especially for you
after she asked the physician.

16:39.680 --> 16:40.840
There's a lot of variety.

16:41.320 --> 16:43.040
It's normal
if you don't like some of them,

16:43.720 --> 16:44.840
but I don't think

16:46.760 --> 16:47.880
you would hate all of them.

16:57.640 --> 17:00.640
Every person has a different taste.

17:01.680 --> 17:03.240
I find it disgusting.

17:04.720 --> 17:06.160
Are you going to force me to eat it?

17:12.839 --> 17:13.880
I wouldn't dare.

17:14.720 --> 17:16.079
I'll ask the kitchen

17:16.160 --> 17:18.280
to prepare some new dishes
with various flavors

17:20.000 --> 17:21.319
and send them to Your Highness.

17:42.520 --> 17:44.520
Haitang, how is it?

17:44.600 --> 17:46.040
- My lady.
- Xue Li.

17:46.760 --> 17:47.600
Xue Zhao?

17:48.360 --> 17:49.200
Sit.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.880
Why did you come out?

17:52.440 --> 17:53.680
Duke Su is coming back.

17:53.760 --> 17:54.960
I want to welcome him too.

17:55.520 --> 17:58.080
I feel embarrassed to be cared for
at Duke Su's Mansion

17:58.160 --> 17:59.120
for so long.

17:59.200 --> 18:01.080
How is Father today?

18:01.760 --> 18:02.800
He is asleep.

18:02.880 --> 18:04.400
Father is getting better.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.880
He looked at me

18:05.960 --> 18:07.080
and called my name today.

18:07.160 --> 18:09.040
I felt so emotional that I almost cried.

18:09.640 --> 18:12.440
I think Magistrate Xue
will soon have a clear state of mind.

18:20.520 --> 18:21.360
What's the matter?

18:24.160 --> 18:25.120
Where are you going?

18:26.440 --> 18:28.840
The meat is ready.
It can be served after slicing.

18:28.920 --> 18:31.360
We won't disturb you
and my brother-in-law.

18:45.840 --> 18:46.800
He's here.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.000
You…

19:06.960 --> 19:08.200
Who are you?

19:08.280 --> 19:09.280
Who are you?

19:09.360 --> 19:11.160
I'm asking who you are.

19:11.240 --> 19:13.760
I'm Jiang Li,
the Jiang family's second daughter.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.200
The Jiang family.

19:16.760 --> 19:18.280
Tortoise Jiang, right?

19:18.840 --> 19:19.960
Tortoise Jiang?

19:20.040 --> 19:22.800
Yes. He's timid.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.480
Isn't he like a tortoise?

19:24.560 --> 19:26.840
But his daughter

19:26.920 --> 19:27.880
is quite energetic.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.680
General, I was going to pick you up.

19:30.760 --> 19:32.080
Why didn't you wait for me?

19:32.160 --> 19:34.960
You don't want me here
at Duke Su's Mansion, right?

19:35.560 --> 19:37.840
Can't I visit my grandson's place?

19:37.920 --> 19:39.440
General, you misunderstood.

19:39.520 --> 19:41.400
His lordship hasn't returned yet.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.560
I wanted to inform you

19:42.640 --> 19:44.400
when he arrived.

19:44.480 --> 19:45.400
Inform me?

19:45.480 --> 19:47.200
My hair is grey from waiting.
Is he back yet?

19:48.080 --> 19:49.520
He doesn't want to see me, right?

19:49.600 --> 19:51.080
I don't want to see him as well.

19:51.760 --> 19:53.240
I brewed two extra jars.

19:53.800 --> 19:54.640
You can have them.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.560
I'm leaving.

19:56.680 --> 19:57.800
Are you General Xiao Dachuan,

19:57.880 --> 20:01.880
who helped the late emperor build
the nation and achieved military merits?

20:02.440 --> 20:04.840
Listen to that!

20:05.640 --> 20:08.760
She is honey-tongued.
She says nice things.

20:09.560 --> 20:10.760
I like that.

20:10.840 --> 20:13.000
I'm going back home.

20:13.080 --> 20:14.120
Let me walk you out!

20:16.840 --> 20:22.120
DUKE SU'S MANSION

20:22.200 --> 20:23.440
My lord, you're back.

20:27.480 --> 20:29.120
Wen Ji, get caned ten times.

20:29.200 --> 20:31.320
I told you, irrelevant people
can't enter the mansion.

20:31.400 --> 20:32.560
Well…

20:53.520 --> 20:54.920
You came back at the right time.

20:55.520 --> 20:56.800
Leave them.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.360
I'll let someone throw them out later.

20:58.440 --> 21:00.120
- General Xiao--
- I know.

21:00.600 --> 21:02.400
He brings them yearly
and I throw them yearly.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.000
Why?

21:04.080 --> 21:05.920
Are you sure my affair
with the wine sender

21:06.000 --> 21:09.520
is the first thing you want to talk about
after not seeing each other for so long?

21:11.080 --> 21:13.200
What's that fragrant smell from the yard?

21:14.440 --> 21:16.960
Xue Zhao and Haitang prepared roast meat

21:17.720 --> 21:19.520
to welcome you, Duke Su.

21:21.840 --> 21:23.360
Is Great Zhao unwilling to lend troops?

21:25.960 --> 21:29.320
They are willing to do it, but…

21:33.040 --> 21:34.880
They want me to marry into Great Zhao.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.360
Is that so?

21:43.240 --> 21:44.480
Just go.

21:48.280 --> 21:50.320
Yes. Then--

21:52.360 --> 21:54.120
I think it's still not too late
to agree now.

21:54.200 --> 21:55.840
You haven't agreed to it yet?

21:57.120 --> 21:58.800
I should find a fast horse for you then.

22:00.400 --> 22:03.080
Li, do you want me to become

22:03.160 --> 22:04.920
someone else's Prince Consort badly?

22:07.040 --> 22:08.840
Duke Su, you must be joking.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.480
I dare not tell you what to do.

22:10.560 --> 22:11.760
If I agree to it,

22:12.280 --> 22:13.720
you won't forgive me easily.

22:14.560 --> 22:15.640
What makes you think so?

22:19.400 --> 22:20.720
I just know.

22:25.480 --> 22:27.280
Do you also know

22:27.360 --> 22:29.120
that Wanning married Li Jin?

22:30.680 --> 22:32.480
Did this not quite work out
as you planned?

22:33.120 --> 22:34.280
Yes,

22:35.040 --> 22:36.760
but it's considered an unexpected gain.

22:37.840 --> 22:40.320
Li Jin is arrogant and proud.

22:40.400 --> 22:41.880
I'm sure he doesn't feel pleased

22:41.960 --> 22:43.240
seeing Wanning every day.

22:44.240 --> 22:46.520
The Li family seems calm on the surface,

22:46.600 --> 22:48.960
but there's a storm brewing within.

22:49.440 --> 22:52.520
Let's see who will take the blame
when the drug loses its effect.

22:52.600 --> 22:53.600
It's a nice move.

22:55.880 --> 22:57.360
I learned it from you, Duke Su.

22:59.520 --> 23:02.480
What about Great Zhao?
Are you confident about it?

23:06.560 --> 23:08.480
I used another way
to let them lend us the troops.

23:08.560 --> 23:10.080
There are no worries now.

23:10.720 --> 23:12.360
When the time comes,

23:12.440 --> 23:14.080
they'll fall into the trap on their own.

23:22.200 --> 23:24.520
ETERNAL PARAGON

23:24.600 --> 23:26.320
Mr. Shen, I've found

23:26.400 --> 23:28.640
the ancient books
about rare herbs that you want.

23:28.720 --> 23:30.560
I've added bookmarks to the records too.

23:31.320 --> 23:32.400
All right. I got it.

23:32.480 --> 23:33.960
Let me know if you need anything else.

24:02.240 --> 24:04.680
My lord, the remaining soldiers
of the Palace Security Office

24:04.760 --> 24:06.800
were banished to the borders
according to your orders.

24:06.880 --> 24:08.280
However, one of them wanted to live

24:08.360 --> 24:09.600
and provided information.

24:10.360 --> 24:13.040
He was in charge of guarding
of the Palace Security Office's armory.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.840
He once heard someone saying

24:14.920 --> 24:16.360
that the Palace Security Office received

24:16.440 --> 24:18.160
more weapons than requested
three months ago.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.680
However, the extra weapons

24:19.760 --> 24:21.120
did not pass through his hands.

24:21.200 --> 24:23.440
Weapons are distributed uniformly.

24:23.520 --> 24:24.360
Each unit sends a request,

24:24.440 --> 24:25.680
the Bureau of Provisions approves it,

24:25.760 --> 24:26.920
and a document is sent to the arsenal.

24:27.000 --> 24:29.200
They'll distribute the number
according to the document.

24:30.000 --> 24:32.520
If extra weapons were received
and not stored at the armory,

24:32.600 --> 24:34.240
that means the extra weapons…

24:34.320 --> 24:35.960
Prince Cheng took them.

24:36.560 --> 24:38.760
Prince Cheng is gathering
soldiers and horses recently.

24:38.840 --> 24:39.960
Weapons are controlled items.

24:40.440 --> 24:43.160
Then not only is the Palace Security
Office not controlling it for His Majesty,

24:43.240 --> 24:45.120
it's also peddling weapons
for Prince Cheng.

24:45.840 --> 24:48.640
That means there is a traitor
in the Bureau of Provisions too.

24:49.200 --> 24:50.160
I checked.

24:50.240 --> 24:53.440
Cao Bin verifies Palace Security Office
weapons at the Bureau of Provisions.

24:53.520 --> 24:55.680
My lord, do you want to go
to the Bureau of Provisions?

24:56.760 --> 24:58.560
Let's arrest Cao Bin
directly at his residence.

24:58.640 --> 24:59.480
Yes.

25:02.280 --> 25:06.280
Dear, wake up!

25:06.360 --> 25:07.400
Dear!

25:08.000 --> 25:10.160
Dear, wake up!

25:10.840 --> 25:11.840
Dear!

25:11.920 --> 25:12.840
We are late again.

25:14.040 --> 25:16.880
They're never tired of using this suicide
for fear of punishment trick.

25:16.960 --> 25:18.280
Dear!

25:20.680 --> 25:22.120
There are traces of burnt paper here.

25:22.200 --> 25:24.400
What did Cao Bin burn
before he committed suicide?

25:24.480 --> 25:26.000
This is Cao Bin's will.

25:26.080 --> 25:27.720
He admitted to colluding
with the Palace Security Office

25:27.800 --> 25:29.680
in verifying the extra weapons.

25:29.760 --> 25:32.640
However, he didn't mention
where the weapons went.

25:33.200 --> 25:35.080
They are lies forged meticulously.

25:38.920 --> 25:39.800
Duke Su.

25:40.280 --> 25:42.520
My lord, he's Director Huang
from the Bureau of Provisions.

25:44.720 --> 25:45.600
Director Huang,

25:45.680 --> 25:46.880
you are quite well-informed.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.280
Are you here

25:49.960 --> 25:51.040
to protect your subordinate?

25:51.720 --> 25:53.120
Please don't speak nonsense.

25:53.200 --> 25:55.400
I just found out what happened
and rushed here.

25:55.480 --> 25:57.520
Your subordinate colluded
with the Palace Security Office

25:57.600 --> 25:58.680
and sold weapons privately.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.760
Do you know about that?

25:59.840 --> 26:01.400
Of course I don't.

26:01.480 --> 26:03.680
The Vice Director is the one
who verifies weapons receipt.

26:03.760 --> 26:06.200
Cao Bin verified the weapons
for the Palace Security Office.

26:07.120 --> 26:08.040
I never expected

26:08.120 --> 26:10.520
the Palace Security Office to bribe him.

26:11.080 --> 26:13.320
Apart from the Palace Security Office,
what other units

26:13.400 --> 26:14.760
did he verify weapons for recently?

26:15.360 --> 26:17.240
I think it was the Imperial Guards Office.

26:17.800 --> 26:18.640
In that case,

26:18.720 --> 26:20.640
the weapons receipt
at the Imperial Guards Office

26:20.720 --> 26:21.600
is also problematic.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.600
I also just found out

26:23.680 --> 26:25.760
that Cao Bin
took all the documents in the bureau

26:25.840 --> 26:28.360
related to the Imperial Guards Office
and Palace Security Office.

26:28.440 --> 26:30.720
He said there seems to be a problem
and wanted to verify them one by one.

26:30.800 --> 26:33.480
So the documents should the items

26:33.560 --> 26:34.720
burned in the fire bucket.

26:36.560 --> 26:39.240
When the Imperial Guards Office
claims weapons from the arsenal,

26:39.320 --> 26:40.520
is there any record?

26:40.600 --> 26:42.280
Yes. Every time weapons leave the arsenal,

26:42.360 --> 26:44.160
the arsenal would record it.

26:44.240 --> 26:47.480
Wen Ji, go with Director Huang

26:47.560 --> 26:49.640
and retrieve the records
for the Imperial Guards Office.

26:50.240 --> 26:51.080
Yes.

26:51.560 --> 26:53.040
Director Huang, let's go.

26:58.840 --> 27:01.440
My lord, are you suspecting
that the Imperial Guards Office also…

27:01.520 --> 27:02.800
Since Cao Bin was bribed,

27:02.880 --> 27:05.320
we need to check it too
to eliminate future problems.

27:06.360 --> 27:08.000
Should we inform General Xiao?

27:08.080 --> 27:11.040
After all, he promoted the Imperial Guards
Office's commander, Zhang Wei.

27:11.120 --> 27:12.800
I don't even inform His Majesty
in investigating cases.

27:12.880 --> 27:14.000
Why should I inform him?

27:14.520 --> 27:15.360
Yes.

27:16.080 --> 27:18.480
LI RESIDENCE

27:18.560 --> 27:19.400
Your Highness.

27:21.200 --> 27:22.280
Where are you going?

27:23.080 --> 27:24.760
Do I need to tell you where I'm going?

27:26.120 --> 27:26.960
I'll accompany you.

27:31.200 --> 27:32.600
Are you going to keep an eye on me?

27:33.160 --> 27:35.680
I dare not. I'm just afraid
that if anything happens to the baby

27:35.760 --> 27:37.480
when Your Highness goes out,

27:37.560 --> 27:39.680
we can't bear the responsibility

27:43.320 --> 27:44.760
How dare you curse me?

27:44.840 --> 27:47.200
Your Highness,
if you insist on refusing my company,

27:47.280 --> 27:48.840
I won't force you.

27:48.920 --> 27:52.040
I just hope you return soon,
Eldest Princess.

28:00.360 --> 28:02.520
I went through all the ancient books,
but found nothing.

28:02.600 --> 28:05.360
I heard you're the most knowledgeable
in the capital, Physician Wang,

28:05.880 --> 28:07.360
so I'd like you to help me find out

28:07.440 --> 28:08.880
whether this medicine exists.

28:08.960 --> 28:11.600
If you can find it,
I'll reward you handsomely.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.600
Don't worry, Mr. Shen.

28:16.160 --> 28:19.280
- I will do my best.
- Yurong.

28:20.360 --> 28:21.720
Her Highness is here.

28:30.120 --> 28:32.680
Your Highness, if you need something,
just ask Yurong to go to you.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.360
Why did you come here in person?

28:34.440 --> 28:37.080
This is such an honor for the Shen family.

28:41.040 --> 28:42.320
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:48.760 --> 28:50.000
Mrs. Shen,

28:50.080 --> 28:52.400
I have something to discuss with your son.

28:52.480 --> 28:54.480
I don't want anyone to disturb us.

28:55.080 --> 28:56.000
Yes.

28:56.680 --> 28:58.720
I also hope no one finds out

28:58.800 --> 29:00.680
about my visit to Shen's Residence.

29:00.760 --> 29:03.960
Your Highness
has never visited Shen's Residence.

29:12.000 --> 29:13.360
Let's go, Mr. Shen.

29:15.880 --> 29:16.720
This way, please.

29:25.240 --> 29:27.400
You came here as soon
as you married into the Li family.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.040
People might gossip.

29:30.600 --> 29:31.680
Gossip?

29:32.280 --> 29:34.280
I already did as you say.

29:34.360 --> 29:36.240
Are you still afraid of gossip?

29:36.320 --> 29:38.600
I'm just afraid
that Mr. Li will hold a grudge against me

29:39.160 --> 29:40.600
if he finds out.

29:42.440 --> 29:44.520
Let's see if he dares to do that.

29:45.080 --> 29:47.560
Forget about him. You, on the other hand,

29:48.040 --> 29:49.640
are walking around when you are pregnant.

29:49.720 --> 29:51.840
If something happens,

29:52.400 --> 29:53.680
what will I do?

29:54.240 --> 29:55.280
Don't worry.

29:55.840 --> 29:57.320
I'm fine now, right?

29:59.760 --> 30:02.160
However, if I continue
to stay at Li Residence,

30:02.640 --> 30:03.720
it'll be dangerous.

30:04.280 --> 30:05.680
Were you mistreated at Li Residence?

30:05.760 --> 30:06.880
He wouldn't dare.

30:07.440 --> 30:09.960
However, I don't feel good there.

30:10.040 --> 30:11.200
I'm so annoyed.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.880
I'm sure you threw a tantrum again.

30:15.240 --> 30:17.080
I only broke a few bowls

30:17.160 --> 30:19.760
and Li Jin dared to give me attitude.

30:19.840 --> 30:21.040
Who does he think he is?

30:32.360 --> 30:33.360
It must be tough for you.

30:33.440 --> 30:35.480
Why aren't you taking me away
if you know that?

30:36.680 --> 30:38.040
The day Prince Cheng succeeds

30:38.560 --> 30:40.200
will be the day we get engaged.

30:41.320 --> 30:42.960
But I want to remind you, Wanning.

30:43.040 --> 30:45.120
No one would treat you like I do.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.600
So you must control your temper.

30:47.680 --> 30:49.600
Don't act bossy towards Li Jin.

30:50.480 --> 30:53.040
He was born with a golden spoon after all.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.640
He never experienced
such grievance before.

30:55.200 --> 30:57.800
For the baby's sake,
you must consider the bigger picture.

30:57.880 --> 31:00.280
Living peacefully during this time

31:00.360 --> 31:01.640
is the most important thing.

31:02.720 --> 31:04.360
All right. I got it.

31:05.120 --> 31:05.960
So long-winded.

31:07.040 --> 31:08.040
Hug me.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.120
Yurong,

31:20.200 --> 31:23.560
what should we name our child?

31:26.640 --> 31:28.280
You must be a part of the child's name.

31:29.120 --> 31:33.720
I hope her life can be calm and peaceful

31:34.280 --> 31:37.720
and as pure as snow.

31:38.560 --> 31:42.120
Shen Ningxue.

31:43.600 --> 31:44.920
I'll call her by her pet name.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.240
Little Xue'er.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.360
All right.

31:51.800 --> 31:53.360
As long as you listen to me,

31:54.240 --> 31:55.480
Little Xue'er

31:56.960 --> 31:58.560
will surely grow healthily.

32:06.400 --> 32:07.400
IMPERIAL GUARDS OFFICE

32:07.480 --> 32:08.760
Duke Su, I wonder

32:08.840 --> 32:09.880
why you are here.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.160
Can't I come to visit

32:12.480 --> 32:13.840
for no reason?

32:15.360 --> 32:16.760
Of course you're welcome here.

32:17.360 --> 32:18.600
However, I see

32:18.680 --> 32:20.920
that you've been busy
with the Palace Security Office case.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.560
You shouldn't have time to visit.

32:22.640 --> 32:26.480
I didn't expect you to pay attention
to the Palace Security Office case too.

32:26.560 --> 32:29.680
This concerns the attempted assassination
of Great Zhao's princess,

32:29.760 --> 32:30.760
which shocked the capital.

32:30.840 --> 32:32.960
It's hard not to know the case.

32:33.040 --> 32:35.640
I heard the case is going to be closed.

32:35.720 --> 32:36.600
It's closed,

32:37.320 --> 32:38.160
but not really.

32:39.440 --> 32:41.400
We realized the Palace Security Office

32:41.480 --> 32:44.040
bribed Cao Bin, who performed
verification at the Bureau of Provisions.

32:44.840 --> 32:47.160
He obtained extra weapons from the arsenal

32:47.240 --> 32:48.560
and sold them privately.

32:50.400 --> 32:52.080
Something like that actually happened?

32:52.640 --> 32:53.920
Apart from verifying weapons

32:55.000 --> 32:57.280
for the Palace Security Office,

32:58.360 --> 33:00.760
which unit do you think Cao Bin

33:01.560 --> 33:04.520
verified recently as well,
Commander Zhang?

33:04.600 --> 33:06.120
Duke Su, please don't worry.

33:06.200 --> 33:08.720
We received weapons
according to the regulations.

33:09.280 --> 33:11.360
We store whatever weapons we receive.

33:11.440 --> 33:13.000
We won't bend the law for selfish ends!

33:13.080 --> 33:15.080
I requested the records
of the Imperial Guards Office

33:15.160 --> 33:16.760
from the Bureau of Provisions' Director.

33:16.840 --> 33:18.040
If there are no problems,

33:18.120 --> 33:19.360
I want to verify it

33:20.120 --> 33:21.200
for the sake of fairness.

33:21.280 --> 33:22.160
Of course.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.560
Xu Zhi!

33:28.400 --> 33:29.240
Yes.

33:30.280 --> 33:33.440
This is Xu Zhi,
our administrator of weapons here.

33:33.520 --> 33:34.640
Greetings, Duke Su.

33:37.480 --> 33:39.040
There's a problem
at the Bureau of Provisions.

33:39.120 --> 33:40.960
He wants to verify
the weapons of our unit.

33:41.840 --> 33:43.320
You must coordinate well with him.

33:43.920 --> 33:45.040
Yes.

33:45.120 --> 33:46.440
Duke Su. This way, please.

33:59.920 --> 34:00.800
Guards,

34:03.080 --> 34:04.720
send my verbal message to General Xiao

34:05.360 --> 34:06.880
and tell him I want to meet him.

34:06.960 --> 34:07.920
Yes.

34:08.440 --> 34:09.719
Duke Su, please take a look.

34:10.520 --> 34:12.199
This is the document
when we request weapons

34:12.280 --> 34:13.920
from the Bureau of Provisions.

34:14.960 --> 34:17.480
This is the receipt
after getting the weapons.

34:17.560 --> 34:18.400
Lu Ji.

34:18.480 --> 34:19.320
Yes.

34:21.120 --> 34:23.120
There are two copies for every document.

34:23.199 --> 34:25.239
One copy is sent
to the Bureau of Provisions

34:25.320 --> 34:26.800
and we keep the other copy.

34:28.520 --> 34:30.880
The numbers match
the records from the arsenal.

34:30.960 --> 34:32.360
Can I keep these documents?

34:32.960 --> 34:33.880
Just take them.

34:33.960 --> 34:36.000
However, please return them
when you're done.

34:41.120 --> 34:42.760
IMPERIAL GUARDS OFFICE

34:47.880 --> 34:48.719
My lord,

34:48.800 --> 34:51.920
it seems perfect on the surface
as if they prepared for this.

34:52.000 --> 34:54.199
Cao Bin burned the documents in a hurry,

34:54.280 --> 34:57.000
so we can't rule out the Imperial Guards
Office getting extra weapons.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.760
However, the records match.

35:00.440 --> 35:01.600
That means…

35:02.440 --> 35:05.560
Extra weapons were brought out,
but the records were tampered with.

35:06.520 --> 35:07.360
My lord.

35:08.200 --> 35:09.920
We learned from the Bureau of Provisions'
Director Huang

35:10.000 --> 35:11.760
that the Military Weapons Bureau
produced more weapons

35:11.840 --> 35:13.520
than what was distributed by the arsenal.

35:14.080 --> 35:16.600
That means Cao Bin did collude
with the Imperial Guards Office

35:16.680 --> 35:19.080
to tamper with the records
and distribute extra weapons.

35:19.160 --> 35:20.280
Make arrangements.

35:21.440 --> 35:22.920
Arrest Xu Zhi.

35:23.000 --> 35:23.840
Yes.

35:29.960 --> 35:34.360
Why would Xiao Heng
investigate the Imperial Guards Office?

35:34.920 --> 35:36.520
For the Palace Security Office case,

35:36.600 --> 35:38.800
it is found that they colluded
with the Bureau of Provisions

35:38.880 --> 35:39.720
to smuggle weapons,

35:39.800 --> 35:42.000
so he suspects
that our unit is involved as well.

35:42.560 --> 35:43.440
General.

35:43.520 --> 35:45.560
You know Duke Su's temper.

35:45.640 --> 35:46.840
He'll do everything

35:46.920 --> 35:48.840
to investigate what he thinks is true.

35:48.920 --> 35:51.280
Moreover, his interrogation methods
are ruthless.

35:51.360 --> 35:52.320
So I…

35:52.400 --> 35:55.560
Did you come to me because you
don't want him to keep investigating?

35:55.640 --> 35:56.480
No.

35:56.560 --> 35:58.440
My unit is not afraid
of any investigation.

35:59.200 --> 36:00.200
But he needs evidence

36:00.280 --> 36:01.840
to investigate.

36:01.920 --> 36:03.560
If he arrests my subordinate

36:03.640 --> 36:05.240
without evidence and punish him,

36:06.160 --> 36:07.720
I won't let it slide either.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.480
You helped me advance in my career before,

36:10.560 --> 36:11.920
so I thought about it

36:12.000 --> 36:13.840
and figured I should inform you in advance

36:13.920 --> 36:15.200
to avoid any misunderstanding.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.680
I won't tolerate him

36:17.320 --> 36:18.560
if he acts unreasonably.

36:18.640 --> 36:20.160
I'm relieved to hear that.

36:26.120 --> 36:28.080
Your Highness is back so late.
Where have you been?

36:28.160 --> 36:29.000
I…

36:30.160 --> 36:31.960
No one will treat you like I do.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.480
So you must control your temper.

36:34.560 --> 36:36.200
Don't act bossy towards Li Jin.

36:37.200 --> 36:39.520
He was born with a golden spoon after all.

36:39.600 --> 36:42.000
For the baby's sake,
you must consider the bigger picture.

36:42.960 --> 36:45.320
I went back to my mansion
to pack up some things.

36:45.880 --> 36:48.320
I remember your mansion
and Shen Yurong's residence

36:49.280 --> 36:50.760
are in two different directions.

36:53.320 --> 36:54.520
You followed me?

36:54.600 --> 36:56.920
Your Highness is still
my wife in name right now,

36:57.600 --> 36:59.240
yet you openly

37:00.040 --> 37:01.440
went to another man's house.

37:02.800 --> 37:04.400
If someone saw that and asked me about it,

37:06.760 --> 37:07.760
may I know

37:09.040 --> 37:10.680
how I should explain it?

37:16.320 --> 37:17.160
Li Jin,

37:17.640 --> 37:20.000
don't speak to me in a sarcastic way.

37:20.080 --> 37:22.880
It's a blessing for the Li family
to have me as a daughter-in-law.

37:22.960 --> 37:26.800
After all, this is a collaboration.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.960
If you sincerely help me,

37:29.040 --> 37:31.120
I will reward you well in the future.

37:31.680 --> 37:33.240
If you cause me trouble here,

37:35.240 --> 37:36.320
sorry,

37:36.400 --> 37:40.560
I will come for the Li family
to take revenge.

37:41.760 --> 37:43.800
I dare not cause you trouble.

37:44.400 --> 37:46.480
I just want to protect you

37:47.040 --> 37:48.400
and your child.

37:50.040 --> 37:51.800
After all, if news of you and Shen Yurong

37:52.640 --> 37:54.400
spreads to the public,

37:54.480 --> 37:56.800
all of us will be embarrassed.

38:04.640 --> 38:05.920
Who does he think he is?

38:07.840 --> 38:10.440
I would've ripped your mouth
if it wasn't for my child!

38:10.520 --> 38:12.640
Your Highness, please calm down.
Your baby is more important.

38:16.000 --> 38:18.960
If I don't deal with him,
he'll walk all over me.

38:23.160 --> 38:26.040
Hello, Xu Zhi.

38:26.120 --> 38:27.520
It's you?

38:28.440 --> 38:29.440
What do all of you want?

38:31.520 --> 38:33.680
Didn't I give you all the documents?

38:34.560 --> 38:36.600
You can check the inventory
and compare them.

38:39.000 --> 38:41.040
Do you think
that after Cao Bin committed suicide

38:43.080 --> 38:44.880
and burned some documents,

38:45.440 --> 38:47.640
we won't be able to find out about

38:48.120 --> 38:49.600
the tampering and forgery of records?

38:49.680 --> 38:50.760
I didn't take extra weapons.

38:51.240 --> 38:52.080
There's no overage.

38:52.160 --> 38:54.800
We've investigated
the Bureau of Provisions.

38:56.040 --> 38:59.440
The Imperial Guards Office
distributed extra weapons.

38:59.520 --> 39:02.000
How do you know
they didn't sell it privately?

39:02.080 --> 39:02.960
Very good.

39:04.120 --> 39:05.120
You're being stubborn?

39:06.840 --> 39:09.520
Don't blame me
for not being lenient with you then.

39:09.600 --> 39:13.560
Don't!

39:17.480 --> 39:18.320
My lord.

39:18.880 --> 39:19.880
How is the interrogation?

39:19.960 --> 39:21.920
He still won't talk.
Let's lock him up for a night.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.320
I think he will confess tomorrow.

39:23.400 --> 39:24.360
Keep interrogating him.

39:24.440 --> 39:26.440
- I can't wait until tomorrow.
- Yes.

39:26.920 --> 39:28.000
Sir!

39:34.440 --> 39:36.040
Zhang Wei,
the Imperial Guards Office Commander,

39:36.120 --> 39:37.600
is leading his men to surround this place.

39:39.800 --> 39:46.800
DUKE SU'S MANSION

39:49.960 --> 39:51.680
Commander Zhang,
what is the meaning of this?

39:52.200 --> 39:53.280
If you want to visit,

39:54.000 --> 39:55.680
you shouldn't bring so many men.

39:55.760 --> 39:56.920
Visit?

39:57.000 --> 39:59.520
I'm not that close to you, Duke Su.

40:00.080 --> 40:02.920
You took my subordinate
without giving me an explanation.

40:03.000 --> 40:05.400
I want you to hand him over in an hour.

40:05.480 --> 40:07.000
What if I don't hand him over?

40:07.920 --> 40:08.760
Try me.

40:22.360 --> 40:23.240
Stay put, all of you!

40:25.120 --> 40:26.640
What's going on, Zhang Wei?

40:27.720 --> 40:28.760
General,

40:28.840 --> 40:30.000
I told you before.

40:30.640 --> 40:32.800
If he disrespects me,
I'll have no choice but to do this.

40:33.280 --> 40:35.760
You must hand over my subordinate today.

40:35.840 --> 40:37.320
Commander Zhang, you are so anxious.

40:38.000 --> 40:39.800
Are you afraid that Xu Zhi
might expose you?

40:39.880 --> 40:40.720
You--

40:40.800 --> 40:41.640
All of you, freeze!

40:45.640 --> 40:46.480
Zhang Wei,

40:46.960 --> 40:48.000
show me some respect.

40:48.080 --> 40:51.480
I'll return him to you within one day.

40:58.040 --> 40:58.880
General,

41:00.320 --> 41:01.160
thank you.

41:04.040 --> 41:05.080
Retreat!

41:08.960 --> 41:10.680
DUKE SU'S MANSION

41:13.960 --> 41:19.360
DUKE SU'S MANSION

41:19.440 --> 41:20.400
Release him first.

41:20.960 --> 41:22.720
Confining an Imperial Guards Office staff

41:22.800 --> 41:24.200
and torturing him.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.520
You've become lawless.

41:26.080 --> 41:27.880
I'm working
according to His Majesty's orders.

41:28.440 --> 41:30.160
You've overstepped, my grandson.

41:30.680 --> 41:34.040
The Imperial Guards Office's case should
be investigated by the Three Offices.

41:34.120 --> 41:36.800
I will send Xu Zhi
to the Three Offices for investigation.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.440
You can investigate with them,

41:38.520 --> 41:40.680
but you can't investigate privately
and torture him.

41:40.760 --> 41:41.760
Does this matter

41:44.160 --> 41:45.480
concern you?

41:48.280 --> 41:49.440
Come on. Let's talk inside.

41:49.520 --> 41:50.880
You can speak here.

41:51.440 --> 41:52.360
Goodness.

41:52.440 --> 41:54.880
You've become so arrogant

41:54.960 --> 41:56.800
after you left my tutelage.

41:56.880 --> 41:59.600
Eight years ago, my father died bizarrely,
but you didn't investigate.

42:00.680 --> 42:03.280
Now, I want to investigate someone
you promoted, and you came to save him.

42:03.360 --> 42:04.760
Do you know what you're doing?

42:04.840 --> 42:07.120
Your father's death was an accident.

42:17.760 --> 42:18.720
Release him first

42:19.760 --> 42:20.920
and come home with me to discuss.

42:21.920 --> 42:23.200
I no longer have a home.

42:27.000 --> 42:28.120
Shut the door.

42:41.680 --> 42:45.200
DUKE SU'S MANSION

42:49.240 --> 42:50.800
Unapproved arrest, detainment, torture.

42:50.880 --> 42:52.400
Can't you change your methods?

42:52.480 --> 42:54.120
The Imperial Guards Office
is the imperial army,

42:54.200 --> 42:55.920
not literary officials
who are scared of you.

42:56.000 --> 42:58.120
This is the result
if you can't suppress them.

42:58.200 --> 42:59.360
Why didn't Your Majesty say

43:00.080 --> 43:02.920
that all these years, they only dare
to report me after the fact?

43:03.000 --> 43:04.360
Save it.

43:04.440 --> 43:06.360
The whole incident is clear to me.

43:06.440 --> 43:08.640
The Bureau of Provisions and Imperial
Guards Office might be both problematic.

43:08.720 --> 43:11.200
Why didn't you choose an easier method
but go for the hard way instead?

43:11.280 --> 43:12.760
Can't you learn from your grandfather?

43:18.720 --> 43:20.240
It seems like he submitted one as well.

43:20.320 --> 43:21.200
He did submit one.

43:21.760 --> 43:23.200
He's the only one who pleads for you.

43:23.280 --> 43:24.640
Zhang Wei surrounding your mansion

43:24.720 --> 43:25.840
is the talk of the town now.

43:26.320 --> 43:28.800
Many people don't like
how you act first and report later

43:28.880 --> 43:30.680
and arrest and torture people
without evidence.

43:30.760 --> 43:33.240
So now, everyone is using
the Imperial Guards Office's case

43:33.320 --> 43:34.920
to complain about you.

43:36.040 --> 43:37.680
Every one of them is reporting you.

43:37.760 --> 43:38.960
How can I protect you?

43:39.040 --> 43:39.880
Isn't that great?

43:40.760 --> 43:43.280
You can see the factions
in the Imperial Court at once.

43:43.360 --> 43:44.800
Public opinion turns lies into truth.

43:45.280 --> 43:46.280
Release him first.

43:46.360 --> 43:48.520
- Go home and rest for a few days.
- How can I rest at a time like this?

43:48.600 --> 43:50.480
This is the time
when you should go back and rest!

43:53.120 --> 43:55.480
You'd easily break if you're too strong.
There's a limit to everything.

43:56.040 --> 43:57.400
It's time to reflect on yourself.

43:57.880 --> 43:59.120
I've issued an imperial edict.

43:59.200 --> 44:00.920
Stay at home and reflect for two days.
